    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">TXNM made a $5.0 million equity contribution to Services Company on January 3, 2005. TXNM also made a $20.0 million equity contribution to Services Company November 29, 2016. TXNM also made a $24.0 million equity contribution to Services Company June 21, 2023. In 2024, TXNM made equity contributions of $63.5 million to Services Company. These steps were taken to provide Services Company with liquidity for its operations.</span>
      </div>
